  "comments": "<p>Rice is a staple food in Guyana. Its cultivation is deeply rooted in the country's culture and history.<br><br>Different fonts are used for different years:<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5bd5d80c44b2e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5bd5d80c44b2e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5bd5d8184e65e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5bd5d8184e65e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5bd5d82260cac.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5bd5d82260cac.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>While still legal tender, this coin is no longer ordered for circulation by the Bank of Guyana.</p>",
